---
name: Forward HarfangLab findings and audit events
description: |
  Keeps only the events that a SIEM needs in full: detection findings, which
  include IOC, Sigma, YARA, and antivirus matches, and the API activity of
  the Manager's audit log.
---

every 1min {
  harfanglab::fetch "https://example.hurukai.io:8443",
    token=secret("harfanglab-api-token")
}
where class_uid in [2004, 6003]
